  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In France, the ICRC promotes IHL and facilitates ICRC operations through dialogue with government, military and diplomatic officials. France&apos;s international role makes it an important arena for the promotion of humanitarian work, and our presence in Paris helps us to help conflict victims worldwide.</narrative>
